# PART 2 : CREATE PROPERTY OBJECT

# ==========================================

STEP 1:
Click Setup (Gear Icon)

STEP 2:
Search:
Object Manager

STEP 3:
Click:
Create -> Custom Object

STEP 4:
Fill details:

Label:
Property

Plural Label:
Properties

Object Name:
Property

Record Name:
Property Name

Data Type:
Text

STEP 5:
Enable:
✔ Allow Reports
✔ Allow Activities
✔ Track Field History

STEP 6:
Click Save

