# PART 3 : CREATE FIELDS FOR PROPERTY OBJECT

# ==========================================

Create following fields:

1. Property Type
   Type: Picklist
   Values:
   Apartment
   House
   Office
   Shop

2. Rent Amount
   Type: Currency

3. Address
   Type: Text Area

4. Availability
   Type: Checkbox

5. Owner Name
   Type: Text

